                    "body": "sorry about that i didn't express my problem clearly.  \r\nIn this case , I think it should not add } because it was already existed.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5cdc98aa-1a0f-45ef-ba85-9f8ca5f956d5\r\n\r\n",
